  "as far as the eye could see, nothing could be seen except cornfields.": "极目远望，除了一大片小麦田以外，就甚么也看不见了。",
  "as far as the teacher was concerned, she was a joy to teach.": "就一个老师而言，她教书教得很快乐。",
  "as food and drink is to animals, so are rain and sunshine to plants.": "动物需要食物和饮料，而植物则需要雨水和阳光。",
  "as for me, i am satisfied.": "就我而言，我很满意。",
