  "as for me, there is nothing more i want to say.": "至于我, 我没有什么更多要说的。",
  "as global warming increases, sea levels get higher and higher.": "海面随着全球变暖的加剧而越来越高。",
  "as he had no way of making fire, he ate the fish raw.": "他没有办法生火，便只好把鱼活生生的吃掉。",
  "as he spoke, pictures came into my mind.": "他说的时候，我脑中浮现出了画面。",
