  "as i entered the room, they applauded.": "我进屋的时候，他们都鼓掌了。",
  "as i love her, so she loved me.": "正如我爱她，所以她爱我。",
  "as i returned from school yesterday, i was caught in a sudden shower.": "昨天我在放学回家的路上突然遇上了一阵大雨。",
  "as i was sick, i did not go to school.": "由于我生病了，我便没去上学。",
  "as if!": "你少臭美！",
  "as is evident from the data, smoking is not decreasing among the young.": "数据表明年轻人抽烟的现象没有减少。",
  "as is often the case with him, he went to the office without shaving.": "他一如往常，没有剃胡子就上班去了。",
  "as is often the case with young people, he was indifferent to money.": "年轻人对金钱总是没甚么兴趣，他也不例外。",
  "as is often the case, mike was late for the meeting this afternoon.": "麦克今天下午的会议迟到了，这是常有的事。",
  "as it is written in simple english, this book is easy to read.": "由于是用简单的英语所写的，这本书很容易阅读。",
  "as it is, i can not pay you.": "正因为如此，我不能付钱给你。",
  "as it is, prices are going up every week.": "事实上，价格每个星期都在攀升。",
  "as long as good people do nothing, evil will triumph.": "只要好人袖手旁观，恶人就会得胜。",
  "as long as there's no meat, anything is fine.": "只要没有肉，都可以。",
