  "as long as you are here, we might as well begin.": "既然你在这里, 那我们就开始吧。",
  "as long as you keep quiet, you can stay here.": "只要你保持安静, 你可以留在这里。",
  "as long as you're here, i'll stay.": "只要你在这儿，我就会留下来。",
  "as long as you’ve prepared, you won’t have any problems.": "只要你准备了，你就不会遇到问题。",
  "as many as a thousand people were there.": "当时有多达千人在那里。",
  "as more paper money came into use, the value fell.": "当更多的纸币投入使用，价格就下跌了。",
  "as my room faces south, it is not so cold even in winter.": "因为我的房间面向南边, 即使在冬天都不会那么冷。",
  "as often as she tried, she failed.": "她每次的尝试都失败了",
  "as people get older, their brain cells become less efficient.": "随著人们年龄的增长，其脑细胞就变得比较没有效率。",
  "as she's a very practical person, she often fixes her friends' cars.": "因为她是一个喜欢动手实践的人，她常常把朋友的汽车修好。",
  "as soon as he sat down, he picked up the telephone.": "他一坐下，就拿起了电话。",
  "as soon as he saw a policeman, he ran away.": "他一看见警察就逃走了。",
  "as soon as he saw me, he ran away.": "他一看见我，就跑了。",
  "as soon as he saw the policeman, he ran for it.": "他看到了警察，就逃之夭夭了。",
  "as soon as i get paid i will pay you back.": "我一收到钱就马上还钱给你。",
  "as soon as i get to london, i'll drop you a line.": "我一到伦敦就会给你留言的。",
  "as soon as i have a dog, i'll start going for walks frequently.": "我一有小狗，就会开始常常散步。",
  "as soon as i left home, i ran into her.": "我一离开家就遇见了她。",
  "as soon as i've finished doing that, i'll help you.": "等我做完那活儿就帮你。",
  "as soon as man is born, he begins to die.": "从出生的一刻开始，我们就在步向死亡。",
  "as soon as she finished, she lay down and had a nap.": "她刚结束，就躺下打了个盹儿。",
