  "as soon as she opened the door, a cat ran out.": "她一开门，一只猫就跑了出来。",
  "as soon as she read the letter, she began to cry.": "她一开始读那封信就哭了起来。",
  "as soon as she wakes up, we'll turn on the music.": "她一醒，我们就放音乐。",
  "as soon as the bell rang the teacher came into the classroom.": "钟声一响起，老师就走进了教室。",
  "as soon as the door opened, they ran away.": "门一开，他们就逃走了。",
  "as soon as tom sat down, he started eating.": "汤姆一坐下就开始吃东西。",
  "as such is the case, i am sorry i can't accept your kind invitation.": "照这样的情况，很抱歉，我不能接受你的盛情邀请。",
  "as the lion is king of beasts, so is the eagle king of birds.": "如果狮子是百兽之王的话，鹰就是百鸟之王了。",
